{"id":"5d8dd49e5f3240a8","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-dense-subsite-comparison.md","title":"Theorem — 稠密满子站点比较","display":"Theorem — 稠密满子站点比较","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-dense-subsite-comparison","aliases":["14-thm-dense-subsite-comparison"],"display":"Theorem — 稠密满子站点比较","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-small-site]]","[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]","[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","[[14-df-category-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-dense-subsite-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-dense-subsite-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 稠密满子站点比较"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5036bba7ca747e71\" href=\"?note=5036bba7ca747e71\" title=\"14-df-small-site\">14-df-small-site</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55b5b594c94a4b33\" href=\"?note=55b5b594c94a4b33\" title=\"14-df-sieve-pullback\">14-df-sieve-pullback</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3fcbbf29a7947555\" href=\"?note=3fcbbf29a7947555\" title=\"14-df-grothendieck-topology\">14-df-grothendieck-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1601eff2507fda14\" href=\"?note=1601eff2507fda14\" title=\"14-df-functor-full-subcategory\">14-df-functor-full-subcategory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为站点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是指定满子范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 为包含。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\">\\(D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span>-筛。生成筛各式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h,r\">\\(g,h,r\\)</span> 均是所注明 Hom 集中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(F_0,F_1)\">\\(F=(F_0,F_1)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 上预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(F,G,\\alpha)\">\\((F,G,\\alpha)\\)</span> 为其间自然变换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{\\mathcal D}\">\\(J_{\\mathcal D}\\)</span> 是下式给出的诱导覆盖；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i^*\">\\(i^*\\)</span> 的对象与箭头映射先按预层限制定义，在所列覆盖密度条件下取值于层范畴。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_C:=\\{h\\circ g\\mid D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D),\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C),\\ g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,D)\\},\\quad\\langle R\\rangle_{\\mathcal C}:=\\{r\\circ g\\mid r\\in R,\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,\\operatorname{dom}(r))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_C:=\\{h\\circ g\\mid D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D),\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C),\\ g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,D)\\},\\quad\\langle R\\rangle_{\\mathcal C}:=\\{r\\circ g\\mid r\\in R,\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,\\operatorname{dom}(r))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J_{\\mathcal D}(D):=\\{R\\mid\\operatorname{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal D}(R,D)\\land\\langle R\\rangle_{\\mathcal C}\\in J(D)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J_{\\mathcal D}(D):=\\{R\\mid\\operatorname{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal D}(R,D)\\land\\langle R\\rangle_{\\mathcal C}\\in J(D)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_0(F)\\coloneqq(F_0|_{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)},F_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)}),\\qquad R_1((F,G,\\alpha))\\coloneqq(R_0(F),R_0(G),\\alpha|_{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_0(F)\\coloneqq(F_0|_{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)},F_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)}),\\qquad R_1((F,G,\\alpha))\\coloneqq(R_0(F),R_0(G),\\alpha|_{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"i^*\\coloneqq\\bigl(R_0|_{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))},R_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[i^*\\coloneqq\\bigl(R_0|_{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))},R_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ S_C\\in J(C)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\operatorname{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D)\\land\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(i^*,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J),\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal D,J_{\\mathcal D}))\\land\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(i^*)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ S_C\\in J(C)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\operatorname{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D)\\land\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(i^*,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J),\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal D,J_{\\mathcal D}))\\land\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(i^*)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Appendix 的 Comparison Lemma。稠密条件要求由 D 来源箭头生成的筛覆盖，不要求该覆盖筛内每个箭头源都属于 D；后者在基开集例子中通常过强。限制函子全忠实来自局部延拓的唯一性，本质满射由稠密覆盖上的粘合重建。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-small-site","status":"resolved","id":"5036bba7ca747e71","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-site]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve-pullback","status":"resolved","id":"55b5b594c94a4b33","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-pullback]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-grothendieck-topology","status":"resolved","id":"3fcbbf29a7947555","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-grothendieck-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor-full-subcategory","status":"resolved","id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"g,h,r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"F=(F_0,F_1)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"(F,G,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"J_{\\mathcal D}","display":false},{"tex":"i^*","display":false},{"tex":"S_C:=\\{h\\circ g\\mid D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D),\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C),\\ g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,D)\\},\\quad\\langle R\\rangle_{\\mathcal C}:=\\{r\\circ g\\mid r\\in R,\\ B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C),\\ g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,\\operatorname{dom}(r))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"J_{\\mathcal D}(D):=\\{R\\mid\\operatorname{IsSieve}_{\\mathcal D}(R,D)\\land\\langle R\\rangle_{\\mathcal C}\\in J(D)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"R_0(F)\\coloneqq(F_0|_{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)},F_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)}),\\qquad R_1((F,G,\\alpha))\\coloneqq(R_0(F),R_0(G),\\alpha|_{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)}).","display":true},{"tex":"i^*\\coloneqq\\bigl(R_0|_{\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))},R_1|_{\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ S_C\\in J(C)\\bigr)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(\\operatorname{IsGrothendieckTopology}(J_{\\mathcal D},\\mathcal D)\\land\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(i^*,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J),\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal D,J_{\\mathcal D}))\\land\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(i^*)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2525,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-295","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-dense-subsite-comparison|Theorem — 稠密满子站点比较]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-dense-subsite-comparison]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-dense-subsite-comparison|Theorem — 稠密满子站点比较]]"}],"outgoing":["898681611f432286","5036bba7ca747e71","e21